    "description_raw": "Bane fills your enemies with fear and doubt. Each affected creature takes a -1 penalty on attack rolls and a -1 penalty on saving throws against fear effects. Bane counters and dispels bless.\nMythic Bane\nThe –1 penalty applies on attack rolls, weapon damage rolls, and all saving throws.\n\nEach affected creature must roll its next attack roll or saving throw twice and take the lower result.",
